WEBVTT

00:11:29.436 --> 00:11:32.356
not just great lawyers,

00:11:32.396 --> 00:11:35.036
especially when those things

00:11:35.076 --> 00:11:38.516
are not likely to get them
promoted as lawyers.

00:11:39.436 --> 00:11:43.356
In hindsight, I wish
I'd had way more experience

00:11:43.396 --> 00:11:46.876
in things like community justice,

00:11:46.876 --> 00:11:50.036
technology and management.

00:11:50.556 --> 00:11:54.556
And I so wish I could have gone
to judge school.

00:11:55.836 --> 00:11:59.996
Better prepared lawyers
would mean better inputs

00:11:59.996 --> 00:12:03.956
for those people who choose
and manage judges